0..77 Comment "// The completion subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
78..150 Comment "// every source that reads them (`import \"./ring-base.gandr\" ;`): a mock"
151..229 Comment "// kernel\'s submission protocol after io_uring, whose manual states that there"
230..304 Comment "// is \"exactly one matching CQE for every SQE\" (io_uring(7)). A submission"
305..380 Comment "// queue entry is received and one completion queue entry is posted; on the"
381..458 Comment "// submitter\'s side, what remains after a submit is the pending completion it"
459..536 Comment "// must reap. The buffer a read fills is moved into its submission and handed"
537..615 Comment "// back with its completion, because the kernel owns it while the operation is"
616..664 Comment "// in flight (boats, _Notes on io-uring_, 2020)."
666..738 Comment "/// A ring: its entries sealed behind the interface, the protocol of one"
739..816 Comment "/// submission as the kernel serves it, the buffer and the pending completion"
817..873 Comment "/// on the submitter\'s side, and one entry of each kind."
